  "description": "Colorblind comic author Seon Jung meets chef Jihwan Cha while preparing for his new comic. However, the star chef is as arrogant as he is handsome, and has something to do with Seon’s past lover who left him heartbroken…\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/120033418)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=170308), [MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/3496), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/120042454), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/antor_ancn), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/colorless_odorless), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5849513), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_colorless_wz)  \nR15: [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=170315), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51007622), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3385726)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [English](https://lalatoon.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/7211)  \nR15: [S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc30294)",
